# Conformance probe pack for the locator `until:<code>` (spec 0.22, Character
# fields that end at a code) with `chars:icao6` and the terminator code 0, a
# code the set gives no character (ruling 9). Public. No kinds. Most
# significant bit first.
#
#   label  6-bit characters up to the code 0, which is consumed
#   y      8 bits after the terminator
format     conformance-long-until-icao6
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  until:0  chars:icao6
field   probe.y      8        uint
